#!args --test async
# (Rust only) plattest --test async: plat::task (executors, wake-ups from other threads, the
# blocking pool, cancellation, timers, the virtual clock, Progress) and plat::aio (chunked reads,
# atomic writes and copies with progress, cancelled between chunks; AtomicFile); children for
# panics in tasks / jobs and for aio under a manifest. The whole test runs before the UI starts
# and ends the process with the number of failures.
